{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55619","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十七 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松萝闲锁一身孤，履道安禅是密谟。\n借问野云谁断续，思量春草自荣枯。\n多见异兽心堪伏，来惯幽禽不用呼。\n万物尽从成熟得，莫教容易丧工夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}